<title>RUSSIA: Russia to present Eurobond Mar 11 in Germany - MoF.</title>
<headline>Russia to present Eurobond Mar 11 in Germany - MoF.</headline>
<dateline>MOSCOW 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finance Minister Alexander Livshits will make a presentation on Russia's second Eurobond issue on March 11 in Germany, Prime-Tass news agency quoted government sources as saying on Thursday.</p>
<p>Lishits said on Thursday that Russia would issue the mark-denominated Eurobond within two weeks, after the completion of a road-show.</p>
<p>Government officials have put the likely volume of the issue at between one to 1.5 billion marks.</p>
<p>--Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520</p>
